    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d41">

                <pb facs="0098" n="84" xml:id="pg84"/>

                <head>EXHIBIT Z.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Vladivostock</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-09-27"><hi rendition="#italic">September 27,
                        1892</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Supplementary to my letter to you of the
                    20th instant, having heard that the seizure of my ship was made on suspicion of
                    my having aided vessels engaged in sealing in the Okotchk Sea, I beg to state
                    again that the Russian officer (Lieutenant Coule) who seized my ship stated
                    distinctly at the time of seizure that I was taken for whaling in the Okotchk
                    Sea, and my officers and crew declare that he specially stated and declared the
                    same to them when they were transferred to the schooner <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Marie</hi> from my ship.</p>
                <p>Furthermore, I declare that on the passage down to this port he again explicitly
                    stated that he made the seizure on account of whaling in the Okotchk, and said
                    that if I had not had two whales on board he would have released me and simply
                    warned me to leave the sea.</p>
                <p>Respectfully, yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Thomas Scullun</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Master, “Cape Horn Pigeon.</hi>”</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Commander <hi rendition="#small-caps">Charles V. Gridley</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">U. S. N.,<lb/>Commanding U. S. S. “Marion,”
                            Vladivostock.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d41-a1.xml" xpointer="d41-a1"/>
